==English==
[[Image:Backstroke (PSF).png|thumb|300px|the '''backstroke''']]

===Etymology===
{{compound|back|stroke|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
{{wikipedia}}
* {{audio|en-us-backstroke.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[swimming]] [[stroke]] swum lying on one's [[back]], while rotating both [[arm]]s through the water as to [[propel]] the swimmer [[backwards]].
# {{context|bellringing|lang=en}} The [[pull]] on the [[tail]] of the [[rope]] that swings the [[bell]] through a full circle (compare [[handstroke]])

